Track 1: La Estática nos juzga
- Story & Context: In the flooded cellar of the abandoned Radio Torre, Mateo found a handwritten note dated twenty years prior that smelled of ozone and wet ash, right before the lights flickered out and the speakers shrieked. "La verdad quema más que el rayo mismo," he hissed into the mic, his voice bleeding into the crackle of the approaching gale. 
